OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man and woman
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai (Irish police) are investigating
OL,7,Fafter a woman in her 40s and a man in
OL,8,Fhis 30s were found dead at a house in
OL,9,FCounty Dublin.
OL,11,FTheir bodies were discovered at the
OL,12,Fproperty in Cois Cairn, Old Connaught
OL,13,FAvenue, on the outskirts of Bray,
OL,14,Fshortly after 08:00 local time on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FThey have been named locally as couple
OL,18,FBridgid 'Biddy' O'Brien and James
OL,19,FMcGinn, according to Irish broadcaster
OL,20,FRTE.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
