OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man and woman
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, gardai said the outcome
OL,7,Fof post-mortem examinations would
OL,8,Fassist in determining the course of the
OL,9,Finvestigation.
